  "scope": "Static dispatcher scan of the integrated Worker. Observed method guards only; this is not a complete permission or runtime contract. Bookmark and history POST writes now require positive safe-integer identifiers and an exact published chapter belonging to a published, rights-eligible novel; validation occurs before persistence. Community POST handlers now use strict positive safe-integer identifiers and published rights-eligible targets; comment/report quotas and duplicate report claims are database-trigger enforced. Worker source fingerprint refreshed to the exact source blob for the personalized-route noindex correction; this change does not expand route access or object ownership. Explicit bookmark removal is DELETE on the singular /api/bookmark resource; the plural /api/bookmarks resource is the authenticated GET list. OmniPortal connector registry seeding now uses a normalized NOT EXISTS guard; the public status projection deduplicates normalized base URLs and preserves the enabled/authorized representative. Administrator connector creation validates an allowlisted HTTPS origin, rejects duplicate URLs and creates new entries disabled/pending. No route signature was added or removed. The Worker source fingerprint is refreshed after the leaderboard chapter/time index addition; no route signature changed. Public author directory GET handler is moved before schema/session bootstrap and enforces bounded rights-filtered aggregate reads. Creator Studio and Publishing Studio routes are delegated by the Worker to separately owned modules; sourceFile/sourceLines identify the domain handler and workerDispatchLines identify the composition call. The release calendar is Publishing-owned.",
